steamid": "76561198263233335", "personaname": "沉睡的门番", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198263233335/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 192650, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 578, "playtime_at_review": 112814, "last_played": 1788052617, "avatar": "7c2f8dc144ce2a55b6d0e091e27b37d8c3228f10"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "目前1800小时噩梦玩家\n这游戏并不是求生3，真心希望求生转型过来的玩家别当成换皮求生来玩。虽然制作组里面有求生原班人马，但他们设计出来的游戏机制更多是来针对求生玩家的操作习惯的。你在B4B里还像求生2那么跑图和不拿尸潮当威胁的话会死的很惨。\n近期夏促，我郑重建议刚入手时长不过百的新晋玩家先打打新兵难度，卡齐了，有了一定的游戏理解再尝试爬老兵难度，别来噩梦坑人......", "timestamp_created": 1691884484, "timestamp_updated": 1691884484, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 13, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.601480662822723389", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143987143", "author": {"steamid": "76561198972148338", "personaname": "『MrT』霍金", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198972148338/", "num_games_owned": 129, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 25030, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7427, "last_played": 1782905808, "avatar": "95d8f1c00bbdc43e289e494f3dad027a6f930ac4"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "平均玩三局就能遇见一个bug，要么就是卡在某个地方，要么就是一些渲染上的小bug，虽然偶尔影响游戏体验，但是整体很不错，不足之处就是地图太少，而且有些地方重复度高，在地图上的游戏体验一般，但是卡组是这个游戏最核心的地方，根据不同流派能组合出几十甚至上百种卡组，就这个卡组功能就让游戏的重开率大了几十倍，绝对的亮点，推荐60元以内的时候可以无脑入。", "timestamp_created": 1691839707, "timestamp_updated": 1691839707, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "143917860", "author": 